  THE FREE CONTROL. Rung 1 (6.8M) is echoname's taught arm by
  construction -- same creature, same arguments, same budget. Check it
  against the published column:
    python3 tools/dirbudget_control.py \
        results/echoname-sep-full.log <this log> 6.8M
  A single seed differing means the two are not the same call and the
  ladder is void, not merely suspect.

  ACROSS 8x OF BUDGET the excess over null goes +0.1266 -> +0.1667 (x1.32),
  with the last doubling worth x0.87.

  THE ROTATION SATURATES TOO. The last doubling is worth x0.87, so
  budget is closed for BOTH halves of the dissociation: reward's
  magnitude saturates at ~118 Hz (ctxscale) and the lesson's direction
  saturates here. That makes the 0.167 excess at the top rung an
  ARCHITECTURAL ceiling on assignment rather than a budget one -- the
  creature is given 8x the trials and does not finish the rotation.
